meta {
  name: Chat - Completions
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/v1/chat/completions
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{api_key}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "model": "gemini-2.0-flash",
    "messages": [
      {"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant."},
      {"role": "user", "content": "Hello, how are you?"}
    ],
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "max_tokens": 1000,
    "stream": false
  }
}

docs {
  # Chat Completions API

  OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint with multi-provider routing.

  ## Endpoint
  `POST /v1/chat/completions`

  ## Authentication
  Required. Use Bearer token authentication with your API key.

  ## Request Body

  ### Required Parameters
  - `model` (string) - Model ID to use
  - `messages` (array) - Array of message objects with `role` and `content`

  ### Optional Parameters
  - `temperature` (number) - Sampling temperature (0-2). Default: 1
  - `max_tokens` (integer) - Maximum tokens to generate
  - `top_p` (number) - Nucleus sampling parameter
  - `frequency_penalty` (number) - Frequency penalty (-2 to 2)
  - `presence_penalty` (number) - Presence penalty (-2 to 2)
  - `stop` (string | array) - Stop sequences
  - `stream` (boolean) - Enable SSE streaming. Default: false

  ## Provider Routing

  Model names are automatically routed to providers:
  - `gpt-*`, `o1-*`, `o3-*`, `chatgpt-*` → OpenAI
  - `claude-*` → Anthropic
  - `gemini-*`, `google/*` → Google

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "id": "chatcmpl-123",
    "object": "chat.completion",
    "created": 1704067200,
    "model": "gemini-2.0-flash",
    "choices": [{
      "index": 0,
      "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hello!"},
      "finish_reason": "stop"
    }],
    "usage": {
      "prompt_tokens": 25,
      "completion_tokens": 15,
      "total_tokens": 40
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Streaming

  Set `stream: true` for Server-Sent Events:
  ```
  data: {"id":"chatcmpl-123","choices":[{"delta":{"content":"Hi"}}]}
  data: [DONE]
  ```

  ## Available Models

  ### OpenAI
  - gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini, gpt-4-turbo
  - o1, o1-mini, o3-mini

  ### Anthropic
  - claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022, claude-3-5-haiku-20241022
  - claude-3-opus-20240229

  ### Google
  - gemini-2.0-flash-exp, gemini-2.0-flash
  - gemini-1.5-pro, gemini-1.5-flash
}
